<title>NETHERLANDS: KEMPEN EXPECTS BIG RISE IN 1997 EPS.</title>
<headline>KEMPEN EXPECTS BIG RISE IN 1997 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchant bank Kempen &amp; Co NV said on Thursday it expected a &quot;very substantial rise&quot; in net profit per share in 1997.  </p>
<p>Kempen said its forecast was based on the assumption that the climate in the financial markets remained favourable.</p>
<p>Earlier on Thursday Kempen reported that first-half 1997 net profit more than doubled to 28.4 million guilders from 12.4 million in the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
